 *
 *     EffectOperationUse
 *         operation = qualified name
 *         arguments = expressions
 *
 * A code-generation classification may then be attached semantically.
 *
 * This grammar MUST NOT force AST types such as:
 *
 *     GeneratedProgram
 *     GeneratedCPUCode
 *     GeneratedGPUCode
 *     GeneratedFPGA
 *     GeneratedQPUProgram
 *     GeneratedDeviceCode
 *     VendorGeneratedArtifact
 *
 * into the universal AST.
