 *          |
 *          v
 *     domain-neutral AST
 *          |
 *          v
 *     structural validation
 *          |
 *          v
 *     semantic analysis
 *          |
 *          v
 *     effects/capabilities/resources/policies/contracts
 *          |
 *          v
 *     canonical semantic representation
 *
 * Generated source MUST NOT bypass semantic validation merely because it was
 * generated by a trusted compiler component.
 *
 * ============================================================================
 * 46. IR CONTRACT
 * ============================================================================
 *
 * This grammar creates NO IR.
 *
 * There is no:
 *
 *     CodeGenerationIR
